## Startup

- [ ] zero EntityType.UNKNOWN/key-resolution startup errors
- [ ] zero unexpected Exception/Error
- [ ] exact production WildStacker version detected
- [ ] PlexonCore 2.1.0 healthy, or standalone mode deliberately tested
- [ ] /pspawners status accurately reports schema 12, generation and scope

## WildStacker authority

- [ ] placement/merge produces one WildStacker logical stack
- [ ] restart preserves amount
- [ ] native tier/upgrade GUI remains authoritative
- [ ] no Plexon managed database/runtime registry recreated
- [ ] no Plexon floating display authority

